{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_169_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"一、十有九年，春，王正月，諸侯盟於祝柯。晉人執邾子。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"二、公至自伐齊。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"春秋之義，已伐而盟，復伐者則以伐致。盟不復伐者，則以會致。祝柯之盟，盟復伐齊與？曰，非也。然則何為以伐致也？曰，與人同事，或執其君，或取其地。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"三、取邾田，自漷水。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"軋辭也。其不日，惡盟也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"四、季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"五、葬曹成公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"六、夏，衞孫林父帥師伐齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"七、秋，七月，辛卯，齊侯環卒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"八、晉士匄帥師侵齊，至穀，聞齊侯卒，乃還。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"還者，事未畢之辭也。受命而誅生，死無所加其怒，不伐喪，善之也。善之則何為未畢也？君不尸小事，臣不專大名，善則稱君，過則稱己，則民作讓矣。士匄外專君命，故非之也。然則為士匄者宜奈何？宜墠帷而歸命乎介。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"九、八月，丙辰，仲孫蔑卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"十、齊殺其大夫高厚。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"十一、鄭殺其大夫公子嘉。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"十二、冬，葬齊靈公。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"十三、城西郛。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"十四、叔孫豹會晉士匄於柯。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_169_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_169","textTraditional":"十五、城武城。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}